    LLM: 'Game: Pedro. 4p partnerships. Trump 5s = 5 pts. Bid 7-14. 62 target.',
    Player: 'Pedro: 4p, bid 7-14, name trump. Pedro and low pedro = 5 pts. Discard non-trumps, refill. 62 wins.',
